From ticso at cicely12.cicely.de  Tue Jun 22 19:01:06 2004
From: ticso at cicely12.cicely.de (Bernd Walter)
Date: Tue Jun 22 19:01:51 2004
Subject: SRM not initialising cards behind a bridge
